icate, almost magical fabric. The kimono is adorned with intricate, silver-like patterns along the edges. Wangdapao's long, dark hair is styled in a high, elegant bun, with a few strands gently falling around their face. Their expression is calm and composed, with a subtle, almost melancholic gaze. The background features delicate, frost-covered branches to the left, adding a touch of winter or frosty atmosphere to the scene. The overall composition is balanced and harmonious, with a focus on the elegant, flowing textures of wangdapao's attire. The camera angle and lighting work together to highlight the delicate details and the serene, almost otherworldly beauty of the character and their attire."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 305, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 170, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "extra_option", "links": [300], "label": "extra_option", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_option"}], "size": [470.3999938964844, 706], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-693.0361938476562, 626.4085693359375], "widgets_values": [false, true, true, true, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, "wangdapao"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 162, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions"}, "order": 12}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "workspace_info": {"id": "2DPvFpHLLMzmEMupNJKw3"}, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "02